Vatsanapat Babhrava from Patliin Saubhara, Pathin Saubhara 
from Ayasya Angirasa, Ayiisya Aiigirasa from Abhuti Tvastra, 
Abhuti Tvastra from Visva-rupa Tvastra, Visva-rupa Tvastra 
from the two Asvins, the two Asvins from Dadhyahh Atharvana, 
Dadhyahh Atharvana from Atharvan Daiva, Atharvan Daiva 
from Mrtyu Pradhvamsana, Pradhvamsana from Ekarsi, 
Ekarsi from Vipracitti, Vipracitti from Vyasti, Vyasti from 
Sanaru, Sanaru from Sanatana, Sanatana from Sanaga, Sanaga 
from Paramesthin, Paramesthin from Brahma; Brahma is 
the self-existent. Salutation to Brahma.

